        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin NAP-TSR, Baldwin Napa Front Door Handleset with Square Rose Interior Trim</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Napa Handleset is available in a single cylinder, double cylinder, or dummy function. It was designed to fit pre-drilled doors 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/2 inches thick. This Traditional Napa Entrance Set has an adjustable latch for 2-3/8 inch backsets or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from 6 classic knobs and levers for the interior. The Baldwin Napa Front Door Handleset with Square Rose Interior Trim is available in an array of classic finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Napa Traditional Handleset with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. Grip offers 1/2\" passage/privacy function bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt tested to exceed ANSI-BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Napa Traditional Square Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Width: 2-11/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Width: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handleset Length (without deadbolt): 11-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handleset Length center to center (without deadbolt): 8-13/32\"</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-8/9\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Width: 2-19/32\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Standard: 1-3/4\" - 2\" </li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Optional:  1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" or 2\" - 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Napa Handleset with Matching Square Interior Trim, Baldwin NAP-TSR",
                "description": "Baldwin NAP-TSR, Napa Handleset - The Napa Handleset is available in a single cylinder, double cylinder, or dummy function. It was designed to fit pre-drilled doors 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/2 inches thick. This Traditional Napa Entrance Set has an adjustable latch for 2-3/8 inch backsets or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from 6 classic knobs and levers for the interior. The Baldwin Napa Front Door Handleset with Square Rose Interior Trim is available in 6 finishes.",
                "keywords": "traditional entry sets, classic entry sets, traditional front door entry sets, baldwin reserve collection entrance trim sets, grade 2 handlesets, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, dummy handlesets, Square Napa Entrysets, BAL-NAP-TSR, Baldwin NAP-TSR, Napa Handlesets, Baldwin Napa Front Door Handleset with Square Rose Interior Trims, Napa Traditional Handleset with Square Roses, Baldwin Napa Traditional Square Handlesets,"
